<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gucci is Merrill focus stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gucci is Merrill focus stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it had named Gucci Group N.V. a global focus stock.</p>
<p>-- It said it kept its rating of Gucci as an intermediate-term and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The luxury goods retailer opened up 1-1/8 to 75-1/2 in New York.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
